  "notes": "{殺|ころ}す is a transitive godan verb with both literal and figurative meanings.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive) - takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for the object.\n\nLITERAL MEANING (Sense 1):\nTo kill, cause death. Used for people, animals, insects, bacteria, etc.\n\nFIGURATIVE MEANING (Sense 2):\nTo suppress, deaden, or restrain something.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殺|ころ}す: to kill time\n- ⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殺|ころ}す: to suppress one's voice\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殺|ころ}す: to hold one's breath\n- ⟦{感情|かんじょう}→感情：00171_kanjou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殺|ころ}す: to suppress emotions\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{殺人|さつじん}→殺人：13236_satsujin⟧: murder, homicide\n- ⟦{自殺|じさつ}→自殺：03336_jisatsu⟧: suicide\n- {殺|ころ}される: to be killed (passive)\n- ⟦{死|し}ぬ→死ぬ：00669_shinu⟧: to die (the intransitive event; {殺|ころ}す names the agent who causes it)",
